am members. Leads the adaptation to competing demands and new responsibilities; adapts to and learns from change, challenges, and feedback. Fosters open dialogue amongst team members.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Drives the execution of multiple work streams by identifying member and operational needs; translates business strategy into actionable business requirements; develops and updates new procedures and policies. Gains cross-functional support for objectives and priorities; determines and carries out processes and methodologies; solves highly complex issues; escalates and resolves issues as appropriate; sets standards and measures progress. Develops work plans to meet business priorities and deadlines; coordinates, obtains and distributes resources. Removes obstacles that impact performance; guides performance and develops contingency plans accordingly; influences the completion of project tasks by others.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Participates in the creation, review, and negotiation of legal documents by: preparing, drafting, creating, and providing guidance to others on highly complex and nuanced written legal advice, contracts, and/or other documents related to subject matter expertise; proactively monitoring work product of others; and serving as an internal and external consultant to clients and other legal professionals (e.g., counsel, paralegals, and legal assistants).","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Performs and analyzes legal research by: leveraging expert knowledge to gather, interpret, and review legal documents (e.g., contracts, memoranda, and policies); guiding others and conducting complex to highly complex research and analyses of case law and statutory/regulatory authority including but not limited to federal and state laws, rules, regulations, accreditation standards, and/or other applicable guidance; reviewing highly complex industry patterns and trends impacting legal questions or issues; and determining trends within legal research findings and legal analysis to share out information to cross-functional senior business stakeholders to create program-wide strategy and critical business decisions.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Assesses legal risk and/or provides legal guidance by: leveraging expert knowledge of legal principles, business risks, regulatory landscape, and compliance considerations to guide others on legal advice and provide recommendations on matters highly critical to the organization; advancing the creation of legal strategies for senior business stakeholders and championing innovative solutions that mitigate legal risks, create program-wide business strategy, and advance Kaiser Permanente-s mission; partnering with outside counsel on highly complex legal matters; partnering with attorneys to leverage and share expertise and resources in a highly matrixed environment; and proactively monitoring junior-level attorneys and other legal professionals or guiding more junior attorneys in their area of expertise.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Contributes to legal planning and strategy by: leading conversations on the creation of legal strategies for the implementation of future-oriented solutions to unique issues; creating guidelines to resolve complex legal issues through partnership among legal colleagues and stakeholders; serving as a point of contact to senior stakeholders on health plan and/or care delivery business and/or clinical strategies; driving communication with 